+
+Table tests required: routed-to-rs · not-implemented-falls-back ·
+rs-error-does-NOT-fall-back · both forcebacks · no-rs-daemon-at-all ·
+tail-absent-from-routed-set · shim-has-no-minter · addr-named-in-diagnostic ·
